# scratch: the TikTok clip generator and the clips it writes, not part of the
# site. Playwright and ffmpeg-static are in devDependencies for it.
# The rendered clips only. make-tiktok.mjs itself IS committed: it is a
# repeatable tool rather than a throwaway investigation like full-scan.mjs,
# and gitignoring it meant 700-odd lines of working code existed on one
# machine and nowhere else. The output stays out -- a clip is 4-5 MB, and
# video in git is permanent.
tiktok/
